      "value": "Are you sure you were on the correct build? You can check your build number at the bottom of the Quick Menu settings page.\n\nI cannot reproduce any jitter with the avatars you linked. Maybe you could provide a video of your experience?\n\nNote that on the first avatar, the tail does have a bit of \"wobble\" in desktop mode, but that's not \"jitter\". That is accurately translating the quick hip movement the movement-to-rest animation is doing into pyhsics movements for the PhysBone components.",
