      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name}\n\nhttps://youtu.be/kRAB0dpbCGE\n\nI hope that helps a bit.\n\nCurrently because of stuff im not able to go in VR so only a Desktop Video\n\nThe Video has 4 Parts.\n\n1 part is Beta Version with an Avatar where the Tail Gitters alot on movement like Jumping or walking and some other movments.\n\n2 part is Live Version with the same Avatar and how all movements are Smooth.\n\n3 part is Live Version and the Tail is smooth at any movement.\n\n4 part is Beta Version and the Tail Jitters and sometime snaps as it would be stiff.\n\nSecond try with only Beta and 2 Avatars like above but with a different capture programm.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/_SSoe3NsOCs",
