      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Tested it on the new Live and Beta if something has changed but its still the same.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/KkrJQjArlLE\n\nIt makes me nauseous when people walk/run in front of me and the tail twitches the whole time as if I'm playing at very low fps.\n\nMost time its with Longer Tails that have some kind of slow movement.\n\nMaybe it helps but this is the configration of the Tail in the youtube clip.\n\nI even removed the Stretch Modion because that was making it only worse.\n\n----------\n\nEdit\n\nSomeone in the Discord mention it and i notice it too that the effect is Stronger in the Mirror.\n\nAnd it looks like Physbone animations like a tail wag are on half fps in the mirror. (don't know if that should be like this but its new)\n\n(Because Avatars with a bigger/Longer tail will have it more noticable)\n\nBecause someone mention it here my main Test Avatars but they are all Private.\n\nAvatar ID avtr_c65e7025-3fa3-4ba4-9765-26de539681a1\n\nAlso different Avatar from me that have the effect.\n\navtr_3326e302-957e-4eac-be28-ef64d79a61e3 (https://youtu.be/RjYOLwbB1lA) Physbones with stretch\n\navtr_f8f79ab4-d40e-4c53-a65a-3c8596014852\n\navtr_9be7a5e1-c6c9-4dc0-bd7d-fed021cf423d\n\n------\n\nEdit 2\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_2a973e01-105e-479b-b266-5206b3e01afb \n\nFor testing purpose i made a Test Avatar.\n\nIt Uses Physbones with stretch like my last postet Video.",
