      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name}\n\nThe Problem is still there on version 1533.\n\nI also tried to use different Nvidia Driver Versions , Installed a Complete new Windows 10 and 11 with only Grafik Drivers / Steam and VRChat.\n\nStill the same.\n\nRecorded an MMD song with the newest version where its very visible too.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/bNABRMetiB4",
