      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Problem is still there and outside of an Hardware change (whats not possible for me) have i done anything.\n\nFor me its something with the \"New\" Physbones that don't want to run correctly on my hardware.\n\nI tested different Windows Version, Driver versions, Harddrives, Grafik Settings in Nvidia Settings and VRChat..\n\nI mostly give up and at that point i don't think it will ever be fixed because of the tiny user base thats effected from it.\n\nI found 4-5 other people that have the same problem with the same CPU and GPU and so i think its Hardware related.\n\nI only found out that its stronger if VSync is Activated in Desktop mode.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
