      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For me at least all around the Phys bones are working better. There is an astronomic difference from what they were before. They do work better when moving slowly. But I'm finding (at least testing in MMD) that the tail end of the physbones get a bit of jitter at the end every so often depending on the direction it goes. Often when something moves a bit quicker/change in direction. Almost like it has to play catch up.\n\nAvatar ID with same flows \n\navtr_82990eea-2f71-4495-8b11-434afda801a7\n\nAll around for me they are doing better and at least a workable state to perform or film with. The jitter doesn't always happen and sometimes it does.",
